{"id":"wb-1-41","name":"克孜尔千佛洞","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"克孜尔千佛洞","text":"克孜尔千佛洞（维吾尔老文字：قىزىل مىڭئۆي，拉丁维吾尔文：Qizil Ming Öy），又称克孜尔石窟或赫色尔石窟，中国佛教石窟，1961年公布的第一批全国重点文物保护单位之一，位于新疆拜城县克孜尔镇东南7千米明屋塔格山的悬崖上，南面是渭干河河谷。现存编号石窟共有236窟，大部分塑像都已被毁，还有81窟存有精美壁画，为古代龟兹国的文化遗存。一部分的壁画被考古队盗运往欧洲，如德国的柏林亚洲艺术博物馆（洪堡论坛）。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%8B%E5%AD%9C%E5%B0%94%E5%8D%83%E4%BD%9B%E6%B4%9E","revisionId":95188414,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95188414","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/03675e2d8fdc7802af5a987f.jpg","title":"2026年10月的克孜尔千佛洞_Kizil_Cave-Temple_Complex_in_October_2026.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2026%E5%B9%B410%E6%9C%88%E7%9A%84%E5%85%8B%E5%AD%9C%E5%B0%94%E5%8D%83%E4%BD%9B%E6%B4%9E_Kizil_Cave-Temple_Complex_in_October_2026.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bf/2026%E5%B9%B410%E6%9C%88%E7%9A%84%E5%85%8B%E5%AD%9C%E5%B0%94%E5%8D%83%E4%BD%9B%E6%B4%9E_Kizil_Cave-Temple_Complex_in_October_2026.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​2026年10月的克孜尔千佛洞","width":320,"height":213}}